      en: ["Senhit was one of the historical administrative provinces of Eritrea.", "The Monday market in Keren is a premier livestock trading hub.", "Camels are widely used in the area for transporting agricultural goods.", "Livestock accounts for a major portion of the regional economy.", "Traditional wells are essential for watering herds during the dry season.", "The region is well-regarded for its high-quality leather and hides."],
